\begin{abstract}
The Bio-Astrophysical Autonomous Cryptographic Simulation Engine (BAAC-SE v1.0)
is a real-time, core-isolated cyber-physical framework that couples
multi-messenger astrophysical telemetry with homomorphic encrypted computation,
