\section{System Overview}

BAAC-SE v1.0 integrates four primary subsystems:
\begin{enumerate}
  \item Multi-messenger astrophysical ingestion (Gaia DR3, LIGO strain, JWST spectral bands).
  \item Approximate homomorphic encryption via the Cheon--Kim--Kim--Song (CKKS) scheme.
  \item Zero-knowledge bounded-error verification using Groth16 zk-SNARKs.
