  \item ML-KEM key encapsulation for secure export to external verification nodes.
\end{itemize}

This ensures that every bionic actuation decision is:
\begin{itemize}
  \item Cryptographically authenticated.
  \item Mathematically bounded in error.
  \item Auditable under post-quantum security assumptions.
\end{itemize}

